A description's own-line plus fence keeps its trailing blank

````
:: t
: p
+
```
code

  tail

x
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>p</p>
    <pre><code>code

  tail

</code></pre>
  </dd>
</dl>
<p>x</p>
````

````
:: t
: n
+
```
a
  b

see
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>n</p>
    <pre><code>a
  b

</code></pre>
  </dd>
</dl>
<p>see</p>
````
